  "Correct Answer": "105",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "If same-side interior angles are supplementary, the two lines are parallel, so \\(\\angle 2=180^\\circ-75^\\circ=105^\\circ\\).",
